sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Requester
    participant App as Browser app
    participant LS as localStorage
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant Order as Order Service

    loop every 30 seconds while the tab is visible, and on returning to it
        App->>GW: GET /api/v1/orders/alerts?page=0&size=20
        GW->>Order: authorize, forward
        Order-->>App: latest 20 status changes on my requests
    end
    App->>LS: read foc.alerts.seen and foc.alerts.cleared for this user
    Note over App: dot shows when the newest alert is after seen
    U->>App: open the bell
    App->>LS: write foc.alerts.seen = newest alert time
    alt Clear all
        App->>LS: cleared.before = now
    else clear one row
        App->>LS: add the alert id to cleared.ids, latest 200 kept
    end
    Note over App,Order: Order keeps no read state, so seen and cleared live in this browser only
